      245.11,
      195.47,
      366.54,
      204.33
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      224.11,
      455.91,
      271.58
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause repeals Part II of the Kandyan Marriage and Divorce Act(Chapter 113) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effectthereof is to eliminate the requirement of consent of a competent authority for a marriageof a minor and thereby making the age of eighteen years as the minimum age of marriagefor all persons subject to Kandyan Law.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      281.71,
      455.94,
      300.38
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 16 of the principal enactment and is consequentialto the amendment made by clause 2.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      310.51,
      455.94,
      329.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 4 : This clause amends section 18 of the principal enactment and is consequentialto the amendment made by clause 2.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      339.31,
      455.94,
      357.98
    ],
    "text": "Clause 5 : This clause amends section 19 of the principal enactment and is consequentialto the amendment made by clause 2.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      368.11,
      455.94,
      386.78
    ],
    "text": "Clause 6 : This clause amends section 20 of the principal enactment and is consequentialto the amendment made by clause 2.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      396.91,
      455.94,
      415.58
    ],
    "text": "Clause 7 : This clause amends section 29 of the principal enactment and is consequentialto the amendment made by clause 2.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      425.71,
      455.9,
      444.38
    ],
    "text": "Clause 8 : This clause replaces section 60 of the principal enactment and is consequentialto the amendment made by clause 2.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      454.51,
      455.96,
      482.78
    ],
    "text": "Clause 9 : This clause amends section 66 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof this section as amended is to remove the definition of the expression \u201cminor\u201d consequentto the amendment made by clause 2.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
